<title>USA: Atlanta Fed business index -9.4 in Oct vs 3.4 Sept.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Fed business index -9.4 in Oct vs 3.4 Sept.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said its diffusion index of industry business activity fell to -9.4 in October from a revised 3.4 in September.</p>
<p>The production index fell to 3.4 in October from a revised 18.5 in September.</p>
<p>					   October     September revised</p>
<p>Industry Business Index	    - 9.4		    3.4</p>
<p>Production Index			 3.4		   18.5</p>
<p>Prices Received			-11.5		  - 3.4</p>
<p>Prices Paid				2.7		    6.0</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		    - 8.6		  - 5.4</p>
<p>New Orders			     - 6.6		   10.0</p>
<p>Shipments				- 0.3		   15.3</p>
<p>Number of Employees		  - 0.1		  - 4.4</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods	0.5		  - 4.9</p>
<p>Materials Inventories		  6.5		    2.8</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1562</p>
</text>
